aquinas-first-way.logic.r1: argue/scope: A1: read with the necessity on its consequent alone, in_potency ∧ mover_in_act → □(self_mover → act_pot_same), the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(in_potency ∧ mover_in_act → (self_mover → act_pot_same)), C1 (S9) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
